observer-resizes is equivalent: open.rs geometry_lease returns a lease only when attach.leases names this client as
the geometry_owner holder, and an observe-role attach is never granted geometry, so reading it while observing still
yields None. The observable it guards (the observer's grid never reaches the program; geometry_owner unchanged) is
asserted by interactive_attach::an_observer_on_a_terminal_never_resizes_and_stays_live_after_the_operator_detaches.
